      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HAMLET.\nIn heaven. Send thither to see. If your messenger find him not there, seek him i’ th’other place yourself. But indeed, if you find him not within this month, you shall nose him as you go up the stairs into the lobby.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
